  diseaseId: crohn
  diseaseName: "CROHN HASTALI\u011EI"
  generalInfo: "Crohn hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131, sindirim sisteminde kronik inflamasyon
    ile seyreden bir ba\u011F\u0131rsak hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda
    kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, ishal ve kilo kayb\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Uzun s\xFCren ishal, sa\u011F alt kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131,
    mukuslu d\u0131\u015Fk\u0131 ve son haftalarda kilo kayb\u0131 var olmas\u0131
    Crohn hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131nda s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131
    hastalarda hafif ate\u015F mevcut olabilir."
